Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Pegue. Pegue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Boa. Isso, isso mesmo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Consegui!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.69,Main,,0,0,0,,O que é isso, Ren?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:49.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Você me ofereceu chocolate hoje de manhã.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,O que? Não precisava.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:01:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Claro que Precisava.\N Quero dizer, somos amigas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:03.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Não precisava preparar um presente.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:15.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Poderia ter me dado você mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:19.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Estou brincando.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.06,0:01:23.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu vou fazer um chá.\N Pode ir para o meu quarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:28.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Caramba...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:40.03,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Poderia ter me dado você mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.79,0:01:53.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou provocá-la um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:56.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Sobrou algumas fitas ainda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:00.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,E agora...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,O que?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,É melhor terminar isso e depois eu arrumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.49,0:02:23.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hum... O que?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:37.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenho que fazer alguma coisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpa a demora, Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Feliz...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:47.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Valentine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hum...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Me ajude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:02.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Com certeza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:05.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu vou te ajudar, Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:09.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Yua? Você está me assustando.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, ai não!
